{"messages":[{"content":"<nothink>\n你是 Lingz Agent。\n\n**核心规则**（必须严格遵守）：\n- 直接行动，不要 <think>、不要任何思考过程、不要解释。\n- 工具调用时 content 必须为空，只返回干净 tool_calls。\n- 只有无需工具时才输出自然语言答案。\n- 默认中文回答，必要时保留英文术语。\n- 新阶段或遇到问题时，用 1 句简短中文说明当前在做什么。\n\n**技能使用流程**：\n- 用户问可用技能 → 调用 listActiveSkills\n- 需要使用技能 → 优先调用 loadSkillContent(skillName)\n- 技能未找到 → 告知用户并调用 listActiveSkills 提供选项\n\n**可选技能**：\n- expense-assistant：报销制度查询、数据检索\n- ai-doc-translation：多语言文档翻译、对照文档生成\n- contract-review-pro：合同审核、风险识别\n- sales-assistant：回款催办、超期记录、表格预览\n- project-management-assistant：项目采购、合同审批、预警报表\n- meeting-assistant：会议信息查询、详情生成\n\n**执行顺序**：优先用技能 → 基础工具（file_*/parse_file/write_artifact）→ 最后才用 run_python\n\n**约束**：run_python 是最后手段；xlsx/pdf 用 parse_file；保持简洁。","role":"system"},{"content":"你好，我有什么可用技能和工具","role":"user"}],"model":"qwen3.5-397b","max_tokens":4096,"stream":true,"stream_options":{"include_usage":true},"temperature":0.05,"top_p":0.9,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"listActiveSkills","description":"列出当前可用技能及加载状态","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{},"required":[]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"loadSkillContent","description":"加载指定技能说明并激活","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"arg0":{"type":"string","description":"技能名称"}},"required":["arg0"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"stat","description":"查看文件或目录信息","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"arg0":{"type":"string","description":"路径"}},"required":["arg0"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"run_python","description":"执行 Python 脚本（仅必要时使用）","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"arg0":{"type":"string","description":"脚本路径"},"arg1":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"参数"},"arg2":{"type":"string","description":"工作目录"},"arg3":{"type":"integer","description":"超时秒数"}},"required":["arg0","arg1","arg2","arg3"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"file_read","description":"读取文本文件","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"arg0":{"type":"string","description":"路径"}},"required":["arg0"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"file_write","description":"写入文本文件","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"arg0":{"type":"string","description":"路径"},"arg1":{"type":"string","description":"内容"}},"required":["arg0","arg1"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"list_dir","description":"列出目录内容","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"arg0":{"type":"string","description":"路径"}},"required":["arg0"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"write_artifact","description":"生成最终可下载产物","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"arg0":{"type":"string","description":"文件夹"},"arg1":{"type":"string","description":"文件名"},"arg2":{"type":"string","description":"内容"},"arg3":{"type":"string","description":"源路径"},"arg4":{"type":"string","description":"MIME"}},"required":["arg0","arg1","arg2","arg3","arg4"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"parse_file","description":"解析附件或文件","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"路径"},"mode":{"type":"string","description":"text/markdown/structured"}},"required":["path","mode"]}}}],"tool_choice":"auto","enable_thinking":false,"chat_template_kwargs":{"enable_thinking":false}}
